# VADAR Video Analysis Extension — Walkthrough

## Summary

Extended VADAR from image-only analysis to **video analysis** by unlocking SAM 2's Video Predictor and adding a complete video processing pipeline. All existing image functionality remains untouched.

## Files Changed

### New Files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| [video_utils.py](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/video_utils.py) | Frame extraction, video metadata, chunked processing, frame loading, mask→bbox conversion |
| [video_engine.py](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/video_engine.py) | [VideoEngine](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/video_engine.py#32-376) class — extracts frames, provides `video_dir`/[frame_count](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/video_utils.py#169-181)/`fps` to LLM-generated programs |

### Modified Files

| File | What Changed |
|---|---|
| [predefined_modules.py](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py) | Added `SAM2VideoPredictor` import + 6 new classes: [VideoTrackModule](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#722-838), [VideoLocateModule](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#840-878), [VideoVQAModule](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#880-923), [VideoGetFrameModule](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#925-949), [VideoResultModule](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#951-962), [VideoModulesList](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/predefined_modules.py#964-1089) |
| [modules.py](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/prompts/modules.py) | Added `VIDEO_MODULES_SIGNATURES` — API docstrings for [get_frame](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/engine/video_utils.py#169-181), `track`, `loc_frame`, `vqa_frame`, [result](file:///c:/Users/mahesh/Documents/Mahesh/AI/VADAR/demo-notebook/notebook_imports.py#598-605) |
